{"type":"standard","title":"Cindy Holscher","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Cindy Holscher</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q60609936","titles":{"canonical":"Cindy_Holscher","normalized":"Cindy Holscher","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Cindy Holscher</span></span>"},"pageid":59660808,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Cindy_Holscher_2026_in_Manhattan_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Cindy_Holscher_2026_in_Manhattan_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":468},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/Cindy_Holscher_2026_in_Manhattan_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":448,"height":635},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1378640431","tid":"a7124d67-c0af-11f1-8be8-9c074c9aba24","timestamp":"2026-10-05T11:26:48Z","description":"American politician (born 1969)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cindy_Holscher","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cindy_Holscher?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cindy_Holscher?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Cindy_Holscher"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cindy_Holscher","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Cindy_Holscher","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cindy_Holscher?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Cindy_Holscher"}},"extract":"Cynthia L. Holscher is an American politician who represented the 16th district in the Kansas House of Representatives from 2017 to 2020 and has represented the 8th district in the Kansas Senate since 2021. She is a member of the Democratic Party and is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 Kansas gubernatorial election.","extract_html":"<p><b>Cynthia L. Holscher</b> is an American politician who represented the 16th district in the Kansas House of Representatives from 2017 to 2020 and has represented the 8th district in the Kansas Senate since 2021. She is a member of the Democratic Party and is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 Kansas gubernatorial election.</p>"}